ONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(I</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">유형</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">지급 제외자</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">등록금 납입휴학 후 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">년 복학생 중 등록금 납부당시 국가 및 스마일장학금 지급받은 학생</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">국가이공계 수능 및 수시유형 선발대상자</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">미등록</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">미복학자</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014. 04. 23</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">금오공대 학생처장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
